1
00:00:07,858 --> 00:00:08,888
Frame…

2
00:00:10,806 --> 00:00:12,362
Frame!

3
00:00:18,000 --> 00:00:19,141
Book— what's wrong?

4
00:00:19,263 --> 00:00:21,450
I'm bleeding.

5
00:00:22,305 --> 00:00:24,072
Bleeding?
Did you slip in the bathroom?

6
00:00:24,072 --> 00:00:28,357
No— it's from…
what happened last night.

7
00:00:30,935 --> 00:00:33,654
Did you get hurt?
How bad is it? Does it hurt?

8
00:00:33,923 --> 00:00:36,568
Of course it hurts, idiot.
Why'd you even ask?

9
00:00:39,200 --> 00:00:42,826
I'm sorry…
I didn't realize it'd be too much.

10
00:00:46,600 --> 00:00:50,709
Alright— you're not going to school today.
I'm taking you to the clinic.

11
00:00:53,140 --> 00:00:55,055
And don't argue.

12
00:00:55,483 --> 00:00:56,457
Deal?

13
00:00:57,337 --> 00:00:59,779
Give me ten minutes to get ready.

14
00:01:00,744 --> 00:01:03,431
You sit still. No moving around, got it?
